Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.10.67-rt71 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.10.67 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.10-rt
  Head SHA1: 3d07305c4c5ae0be97317c64749e53b6b498ce71


Or to build 3.10.67-rt71 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.10.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.10.67.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.10/patch-3.10.67-rt71.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

